{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212430","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1121243001:0":{"text":"达米安，你面前的这窝小鸟怎么了？","source_cn":"达米安，你面前的这窝小鸟怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x060DDCDD8076A4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121243002:0":{"text":"今天下午，我在月湖村北边捡到了它们。它们似乎被强风从树上吹下来，翅膀摔断了。","source_cn":"今天下午，我在月湖村北边捡到了它们。它们似乎被强风从树...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB939A87E8FDB610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121243003:0":{"text":"我为它们制作了固定装置，想帮它们修复骨折的翅膀。","source_cn":"我为它们制作了固定装置，想帮它们修复骨折的翅膀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DB6274106C6912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121243004:0":{"text":"但是迪恩叔叔和我说，它们不止翅膀骨折了，体内也有骨刺，刺害了内脏器官。","source_cn":"但是迪恩叔叔和我说，它们不止翅膀骨折了，体内也有骨刺，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6373A68A663CF116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121243005:0":{"text":"迪恩叔叔给了我一些草药，这些草药点燃后的香气可以缓解痛楚，我想尽可能让它们没有痛苦地离去。","source_cn":"迪恩叔叔给了我一些草药，这些草药点燃后的香气可以缓解痛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D96F8DBD870EC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121243006:0":{"text":"这些小鸟，死掉了吗？","source_cn":"这些小鸟，死掉了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC335C29A0A1A2538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121243007:0":{"text":"是的……你们来之前，它们的身体已经不再动弹了。","source_cn":"是的……你们来之前，它们的身体已经不再动弹了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D67C72E0BD6F321","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121243008:0":{"text":"为什么你看起来很悲伤呢？它们很快就会睁开眼睛。","source_cn":"为什么你看起来很悲伤呢？它们很快就会睁开眼睛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x357886CD5EA4FD7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121243009:0":{"text":"别拿我当小孩子！我可不会相信这种谎言。","source_cn":"别拿我当小孩子！我可不会相信这种谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F19F17F552EE5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121243010:0":{"text":"我没有撒谎。\n妈妈说过，死亡是沉睡，过一段时间就会醒来。","source_cn":"我没有撒谎。\\n妈妈说过，死亡是沉睡，过一段时间就会醒来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x461209C203E4D0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121243011:2":{"text":"死亡的生命可不会醒来，你的妈妈在骗你！","source_cn":"死亡的生命可不会醒来，你的妈妈在骗你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE417B78B650072D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121243012:0":{"text":"我不想听你胡说了，我要埋葬这些死掉的小鸟。","source_cn":"我不想听你胡说了，我要埋葬这些死掉的小鸟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x131F3941CE7CF662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121243013:0":{"text":"你要把它们埋进土里？不可以，它们醒来时会被压得喘不过气。","source_cn":"你要把它们埋进土里？不可以，它们醒来时会被压得喘不过气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFDC1379BA62E4EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121243014:0":{"text":"呃……我不知道一直以来你是怎么理解死亡的，但是这些小鸟，它们不会再醒过来了。","source_cn":"呃……我不知道一直以来你是怎么理解死亡的，但是这些小鸟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB68CEF8472A5A547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121243015:0":{"text":"我会证明给你们看的，我哪也不去，我要守在这里。","source_cn":"我会证明给你们看的，我哪也不去，我要守在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00F0098342421023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121243016:0":{"text":"你真奇怪！它们已经走了，应该让它们回归自然！","source_cn":"你真奇怪！它们已经走了，应该让它们回归自然！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05F661838B7F7F8","variant_status":"","ma